 2664: //    @param xIntersect, yIntersect: intersection point  
 2665: 
 2666: //    The equations for the two segments (the one we are considering and one of the sides of the element) are:
 2667: //    P1(tt1) = (x1,y1) + tt1*(x2-x1, y2-y1)  where 0 <= tt1 <= 1
